  DTS:Description="Conform the currency master and the daily FX rates into ref.Currency and ref.FxRateDaily through the reference load procedures, then publish the active currencies into Dimension.Currency with their latest corporate rate to USD. Currencies whose rate is more than thirty days old are still published but are reported to the control framework."
