                  <outputColumn refId="Package\DFT Publish Currency Dimension\REF Currency Conformed.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[CurrencyName]" dataType="wstr" length="60" errorOrTruncationOperation="Conversion" errorRowDisposition="RedirectRow" externalMetadataColumnId="Package\DFT Publish Currency Dimension\REF Currency Conformed.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].ExternalColumns[CurrencyName]" lineageId="Package\DFT Publish Currency Dimension\REF Currency Conformed.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[CurrencyName]" name="CurrencyName" truncationRowDisposition="RedirectRow" />
